\newlabel{fig:shore}{{1}{2}{The boundary of the family: exact verdicts (cyan alive, grey dead; $\lambda $ on a log scale), the analytic shore $\min _n T_n(\lambda )$, its straight asymptote, and the point $D=23$ where the shore passes exactly through the Virasoro--Shapiro amplitude}{figure.1}{}}
